Underworld: Blood Wars is a fantasy, action,
thriller film directed by Anna Foerster.

3
00:14:22,105 --> 00:14:28,105
Vampire death dealer Selene fends off brutal attacks from both the
Lycan clan and the Vampire faction that betrayed her.

4
