00:52:41,052 --> 00:52:47,052
Underworld: Blood Wars is a 2016 action horror film directed by Anna Foerster from a
screenplay by Cory Goodman, based on a story by Kyle Ward and Goodman.

12
00:57:28,421 --> 00:57:34,421
It is the sequel to Underworld: Awakening (2012) and the fifth and
final installment in the Underworld film series.

13
01:02:15,789 --> 01:02:21,789
The film stars Kate Beckinsale, Theo James, Lara
Pulver, James Faulkner, and Charles Dance.

14
01:07:03,157 --> 01:07:09,157
Principal photography began in October 2015 in Prague, Czech Republic.

15
01:11:50,526 --> 01:11:56,526
Underworld: Blood Wars was released in select countries on November 24,
2016, and was released in the United States on January 6, 2017.

16
01:16:37,894 --> 01:16:43,894
The film was panned by critics and grossed $81.1 million worldwide against a production
budget of $35 million, making it the lowest-grossing film in the franchise.

17
01:21:25,263 --> 01:21:31,263
The film explores themes of martial arts, sword, vampire, hybrid, ambition.

18
01:26:12,631 --> 01:26:18,631
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and intense.
